          "author_type": "registered",
          "author_id": "488",
          "author_profile_url": "https://www.medicalbillinglive.com/members/index.php?action=profile;u=488",
          "date": "June 18, 2009, 10:21:02 AM",
          "date_raw": "\u00ab Reply #15 on: June 18, 2009, 10:21:02 AM \u00bb",
          "post_text": "I have to agree with Michelle, the ability to change the carrier on a claim level is a rather needed function in today's world due to all the changes.. I don't think I have worked on a PM software that you couldn't make that change on a claim by claim basis.",
          "post_text_chars": 258,
          "location": null,
